[47.657088, "o", "--- M10 lab · VULNERABLE · SCPs on the org root: FullAWSAccess, deny-deepseek ---\r\n    (iam_eval.py: a teaching model of AWS policy evaluation; nothing is sent to AWS)\r\n\r\nAttacker 2 · stolen temporary credentials of HelpdeskAppRole (identity policy: bedrock:* and bedrock-mantle:* on *)\r\n"]
[47.657356, "o", "  [B1] ALLOWED  DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration: switch off prompt logging\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n"]
[47.65766, "o", "  [B2] ALLOWED  Converse through the GLOBAL Claude Opus 4.7 profile (not approved)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[47.657766, "o", "  [B3] DENIED   InvokeModel on a DeepSeek model (the old deny-list catches this one)\r\n         why: explicit Deny in SCP deny-deepseek (DenyDeepseekEverywhere)  [check: bedrock:InvokeModel on arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1::foundation-model/deepseek.r1-v1:0]\r\n"]
[47.657914, "o", "  [B4] ALLOWED  bedrock-mantle CreateInference with an unapproved model (no API key: plain SigV4)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock-mantle:CreateInference\r\n\r\nAttacker 3 · a sandbox admin session used to mint long-lived keys\r\n"]
[47.658121, "o", "  [C1] ALLOWED  CreateServiceSpecificCredential for Bedrock with NO expiry (never expires)\r\n         why: every check passed: iam:CreateServiceSpecificCredential\r\n"]
[47.658236, "o", "  [C2] ALLOWED  CreateServiceSpecificCredential for Bedrock valid for 365 days\r\n         why: every check passed: iam:CreateServiceSpecificCredential\r\n\r\n\r\n5 of 6 attacker requests allowed  (showing B, C only)\r\n"]
